WEBVTT

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:20.830
Kiryu!

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:14.500
Quite a spectacle.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:15.830
Where's Rido Kuran?

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.620
He's still somewhere.

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.450
Zero!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.580
VAMPIRE KNIGHT

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.660
VAMPIRE KNIGHT

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.660
Zero!

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:28.750
Don't be reckless!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.620
Not yet...

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.620
I'm not done yet.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:55.700
Not until I eat you, Juri.

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:02.540
I hate to interrupt your meal,

00:02:57.540 --> 00:03:02.540
but it's already dawn.

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:07.830
It's time the curtain comes down

00:03:03.330 --> 00:03:07.830
on the vampire's night.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:15.750
And can you...

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:15.750
draw that curtain?

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:24.580
Oww... That really hurts.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.500
But your attacks won't finish me.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.950
Yes, you're absolutely right.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.950
I'm not the one bringing

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:34.950
the curtain down.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.450
You're late.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.700
Hurry and finish that thing off.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:55.000
Who are you, but a servant who

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:55.000
can't defy me, and his lackey dog?!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.290
Good bye.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.450
It disappeared...

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.450
Rido's presence.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.500
Yes... I think it's over.

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:48.540
Good job.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.790
You are next, Kaname Kuran.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.790
Don't think that everything

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:57.790
will go as you planned.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.700
I wonder...

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:06.370
I was well aware that once

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:06.370
you gained incomparable power,

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.750
and finished off Rido for good...

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:12.950
you would come after my life.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:15.080
And...

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.290
that you would not be

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.290
able to pull that trigger.

00:05:19.580 --> 00:05:20.580
What?!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:27.870
Zero!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:31.660
Huh? Kaname...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.500
Yuki...

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.580
Huh?

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:38.410
It will soon be time to leave.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:06:01.370
Yes, I knew it all along.

00:05:54.450 --> 00:06:01.370
All of it.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:07.660
Well, we managed to protect her.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.660
Hanabusa, you were trying awfully hard

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.660
to act like a knight.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.580
It was so out of character,

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.580
it was funny.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.910
Out of character?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.910
That label belongs to Seiren!

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:23.370
You said Dorm President Kuran

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:23.370
ordered us to protect Yuki Cross.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.200
Even someone like you

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.200
can lie, huh?

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:32.450
I'm going to put an end to everything.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:36.370
You can do as you wish.

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:37.450
Huh?

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.200
Lord Kaname, that's...

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:43.540
You were all pawns

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:43.540
in order to protect Yuki.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.410
You sense it, don't you?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.410
This presence.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.620
There is another now,

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:51.620
who can protect Yuki.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.450
I no longer have any use for you.

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.620
Lord Kaname...

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:06.450
Hanabusa?

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.870
Are you all right?

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.870
Pull yourself together.

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:16.540
No! I'm happy.

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.830
If we really were just game pieces to him,

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:22.830
he would've used us until we were dead.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.540
Lord Kaname didn't do that...

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:31.500
He really saw us.

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:31.500
And he acknowledged our existence.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.330
I think I really like

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:37.330
Lord Kaname, after all.

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:41.700
Aido sounded pretty passionate.

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:43.870
So passionate,

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:43.870
it gave me the shivers.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.540
Hey, I heard you over there!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:49.370
Anyway, what'll we do from now?

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:51.040
Huh?

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.200
The battle is over.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.120
Dorm President Kuran

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:56.120
has released us.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.790
Accompanying my master

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.790
is the only path for me.

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:14.330
Guess which hand it's in.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:15.580
Huh?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.290
Guess which hand!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.950
If you get it right, Akatsuki,

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.950
I will follow Dorm President Kuran!

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:27.660
Huh?

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:28.750
Hurry and choose.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.370
You already know

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.370
what you're gonna do.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:33.660
Hurry!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.950
He's such a simpleton.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:45.290
Not really honest.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.410
Be quiet!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:47.790
What'll you do, Shiki?

00:08:48.450 --> 00:08:49.450
Hmm...

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:51.700
I'm going.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.830
So that I can break this curse

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.830
with my own hands.

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:56.330
Oh...

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.830
Doesn't that sound good?

00:08:59.540 --> 00:09:00.540
Huh?

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.500
Yo, good work.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.330
Yagari, you're alive.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.620
That's my line.

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:16.700
Your trusted sword gets to

00:09:14.410 --> 00:09:16.700
see the light of day...

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.660
and you're using like

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:18.660
an old man's cane.

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.410
You'll be going to sleep again...

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.410
this time forever.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.580
It's so bright.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.040
Yes, it was bright.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:37.450
Huh?

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:39.660
I used to watch you from here.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:41.450
Zero?

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.410
I watched you as you

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:45.410
watched Kaname Kuran.

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:52.000
Whether it was with him,

00:09:48.410 --> 00:09:52.000
or anyone else...

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.160
You always had a smile

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.160
on your face.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:07.120
And even when I did the unforgivable,

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:07.120
that didn't change.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:09.750
I would be fine,

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.620
giving up every last ounce

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.620
of my life for your sake.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.040
That's what I thought.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:18.500
My entire life...

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.500
You're going to leave too,

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:24.500
aren't you?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.200
I wonder why?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.330
Uh-huh...

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.000
I see...

00:10:55.450 --> 00:11:01.330
Remember, you asked me to kill you

00:10:55.450 --> 00:11:01.330
if you became a vampire?

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:03.080
Yeah...

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:06.330
What if I become a vampire?

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.580
I still don't believe

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.580
that you're a vampire.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:17.910
Huh?

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:19.250
There's no absolute proof.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.200
But Zero, that's...

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:26.160
If you're really a vampire,

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:26.160
drink my blood.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.580
If you're truly...

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:40.580
a vampire I should despise you.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.160
I'm sorry, Kaname...

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.700
I'm sorry.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.250
I know.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.660
Zero's taste...

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:21.830
It's like what he said once...

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.410
I know by the taste of your blood.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:27.580
I understand now.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.910
Yuki...

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.540
Yuki...

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:38.700
Yuki...

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:40.910
Yuki...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.160
It's flowing into me...

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.160
Zero's feelings.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.250
You are a vampire.

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:56.620
Mm-hmm.

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.950
We can't live in the same world.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:02.830
Mm-hmm.

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:07.870
But one day...I will...

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:12.330
I will come to kill you.

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:19.540
Mmm-hmm. I'll be waiting.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.160
No matter what happens,

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.160
we're best friends forever.

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.950
Yes, thank you.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:50.250
Huh?

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.330
I have hurt you the most.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:05.870
Why is it? My feelings for you

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:05.870
always have the opposite effect.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.370
I wonder why.

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.410
I'm sorry...

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:22.660
I'm sorry.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:28.160
I'm the one who hurt

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:28.160
this person the most.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:35.120
For ten long years... I wasn't

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:35.120
even aware of his loneliness.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:40.250
Kaname, I'm sorry.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:46.000
You must do what you must do.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.290
We'd better set out before

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:02.290
the sun is high in the sky.

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:03.910
Yuki...

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.580
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.580
My baggage got so heavy.

00:15:09.750 --> 00:15:11.500
Why did you come?

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.370
But you said it's

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:16.370
almost time to leave.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:20.120
But you're free now.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:28.330
It's because you were here,

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:28.330
that I'm here now.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:31.500
I see... So it's gratitude?

00:15:32.080 --> 00:15:33.080
Huh?

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.700
You don't have to force yourself.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:39.540
You said there were people

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:39.540
you wanted to protect, isn't that so?

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.910
I do have people I want to protect.

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.200
And you're one of them...Kaname.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:56.330
That makes me happy.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:01.160
You must be strong, Yuki...

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:01.160
if you're going to protect me.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.620
My feelings always

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.620
have the opposite effect.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.830
I want to protect you,

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.830
but I hurt you instead.

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.660
I want to cry, but I laugh.

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:19.250
You haven't changed.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.290
Lord Kaname?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.410
Do you remember?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.500
Huh?

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:29.580
Before you lost your memory.

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:33.830
PRECIOUS THINGS

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.080
Don't cry.

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:40.950
Yuki.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:44.950
I'm not crying.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.370
Good boy, good boy.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.000
Good boy.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:58.000
Don't be lonely.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:08.370
Even then, you were able to

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:08.370
see through me.

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:11.950
You protected me.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:20.250
You are the only, and the most precious,

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:20.250
thing in the world to me.

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:31.790
I want to protect him.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.580
Don't you need to say goodbye

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:48.580
to the Headmaster?

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:53.540
No... He might start to cry.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:18:00.330
Of course, I'll cry.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:18:00.330
Let me cry, Yuki!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.160
Oh!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:06.950
Argh! I won't be able to

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:06.950
experience this for a long time...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.040
Headmaster?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:13.080
Awww, you were calling me

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:13.080
"Father" earlier!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.410
I can't breathe!

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:16.580
Yuki...

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:17.910
Huh?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.450
You're going of

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.450
your own free will, right?

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.580
Yes.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:24.200
All right.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:29.370
Kaname, if you make Yuki cry,

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:29.370
I will not forgive you.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:37.830
Thank you!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.750
I'm going, Father.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.080
Oh...

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:57.160
We're not your game pieces.

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:01.330
So even if you disapprove,

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:01.330
we will follow you.

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.330
That's all there is.

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:07.410
Do as you please.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:16.450
Hey!

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.120
Are you trying to

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.120
go ahead of me?

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.450
That wasn't my intention.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.830
Perhaps my legs are

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.830
longer than yours.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.410
What?!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:25.910
What?!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.620
Hey, hey... Geez.

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:40.500
I want my child, Yuki,

00:19:33.790 --> 00:19:40.500
to grow up as a normal human girl.

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:44.330
I want to free her from the fate

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:44.330
of a Pureblood Vampire...

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.370
so she can smile.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:56.540
Juri, Yuki did not

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:56.540
run away from her fate.

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:01.950
But she's able to smile,

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:01.950
like a normal girl.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.700
Calm down.

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:06.290
Goodbye.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:11.750
Hey, how long are you going to

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:11.750
ignore the students, Headmaster?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:13.790
Oh...!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.700
Don't blame me

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:18.700
if you get sunburned.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.330
Uh-huh.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:24.250
I wonder how they're all doing now.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:25.950
Uh-huh.

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.080
Oh, this belongs to Ichijo...

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:35.160
I wonder if he's gone?

00:20:41.410 --> 00:20:42.410
It doesn't suit you.

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:48.790
Uh-huh. It doesn't have to

00:20:42.910 --> 00:20:48.790
since it belongs to Ichijo.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:51.410
Where are you going?

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:55.410
I'm going to return this to Ichijo.

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.410
Return it?

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.750
He'll probably give me

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.750
something in gratitude.

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.410
Hmm...

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.410
I'm coming too.

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.200
Hmm?

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.830
I have to feed you.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.200
Here...

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:19.540
I'm sorry!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:23.790
Everyone, the danger has passed.

00:21:25.830 --> 00:21:26.830
Yuki...

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:33.830
That old man. He created this mess,

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:33.830
he should clean it up himself!

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:35.410
Hmm?

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:40.910
Humph! I'm glad you came.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:48.250
All right! Back up!

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.620
Wild!

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:53.500
Idol! Please come out!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:55.660
Ruka!

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:00.000
Day Class students

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:00.000
must return to their dorm!

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.160
Huh? Zero!

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:03.160
Are you trying to skip out again?!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.290
Come on, come on!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.290
Over here!

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.620
Yuki, I will have to...

00:22:19.660 --> 00:22:21.330
I'll be waiting, Zero.

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:25.540
I'll be waiting.
